this is kind of interesting

12:05.840 --> 12:09.560
because, you know, to have this
double engine failure

12:09.560 --> 12:12.080
on the triple seven, which only
has two engines.

12:12.080 --> 12:14.200
These massive Rolls Royes
engines.

12:14.200 --> 12:17.160
If that really happened, it's
first it's the first time

12:17.160 --> 12:20.400
and I believe the aircraft's
history.

12:20.400 --> 12:24.040
But, you know, add to that a
full electrical failure,

12:24.040 --> 12:26.280
